62.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117862.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117734\r\n\r\nThe root cause of the bug isn't the lack of `_edit_get_position()`, but rather the lack of `_edit_get_state()` and `_edit_set_state()`. This PR adds `position_offset` to the edit state so it can be restored during undo/redo.\r\n\r\n![godot_editor_undo_redo_graph_node](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e931145e-8576-496f-9364-00fffc239f27)\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117862/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117862/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}